# Layout

- `desktop_app/gui/`: UI shells — `main_window`, `pipeline_actions`, `workers`, `satellite_dialog`, `frame_canvas`, `serial_actions` / `serial_dialog`
- `shared/serial_out.py`: UART dx/dy offset send (desktop live test + Jetson)
- `desktop_app/satellite/`: `prepare` → `render` / `generate`; tiles in `tiles.py`
- `desktop_app/pipeline/auto.py`: headless dataset→train→ONNX→package
- `jetson_runtime/`: package load + detect/track
- `shared/`: geometry, schemas, video I/O, landmarks

Import satellite features from `desktop_app.satellite` (stable re-exports).
